; Duplicate and undefined budgets. A second `budget` of a name is reported and ignored: the first one's commodity and
; metadata stay. A budget-add, budget-transfer or budget-close naming a budget not defined at its date is reported and
; does nothing, also to the defined side of a transfer. A posting to an account linked to a budget that is never
; defined is reported once per account and budget, and still booked.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Ghost
  budget: Ghost
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Shared
  budget: Ghost
  budget: Food

2024-01-01 budget Food CNY
  alias: "the first definition"
2024-01-01 budget-add Food 100 CNY
2024-01-02 budget-add Nope 10 CNY
2024-01-03 budget-transfer Food Nope 5 CNY
2024-01-03 budget-transfer Nope Food 5 CNY
2024-01-04 budget-close Nope
2024-01-05 budget Food USD
  alias: "a second definition"
  category: "ignored"
2024-01-06 budget-add Food 10 USD
2024-01-07 budget-transfer Food Food 20 CNY

2024-01-10 * "Shop" "ghost, the first time"
  Expenses:Ghost 10 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-11 * "Shop" "ghost, again"
  Expenses:Ghost 11 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-12 * "Shop" "shared by a ghost and Food"
  Expenses:Shared 12 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-12 * "Shop" "shared, again"
  Expenses:Shared 13 CNY
  Assets:Bank
